cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result tables, please cite the manuscript and this archive."
title: "kappa-C dual-spectrum audit: code and curated result tables"
abstract: >-
  Reference code and curated result tables for a delivery-and-content audit of
  gene-regulatory-network (GRN) prior injection in single-cell variational autoencoders.
  Includes the standalone kappa-c-audit package, the analysis scripts that generate the
  reported results and supplementary figures, and the processed audit outputs as JSON.
